    "group": "Chaos Cult",
    "summary": "Your Damned unit needs Dark Pacts to use a Desperate Pact. Offer the pact when you pick the unit to move normally, Advance or declare its charge. A unit is ineligible on the turn it comes out of Reserves. Take a Leadership test first. Failure makes the unit suffer D3 mortal wounds before resolving the pact. Through the rest of the phase, the unit’s models gain 2 inches of Move and the unit gets +2 on Charge rolls.",
